; Experimental, limited Vice City 1.0 EN ABI; no module is enabled by default.
; UTF-8. Flat filenames only, at most 32 modules.
; A SHA-256 pins identity, not ABI compatibility or safety.
; Enable only an ABI-reviewed binary documented for this version of reVC.
[Modules]
; ReviewedMod.asi=REPLACE_WITH_64_HEXADECIMAL_SHA256_DIGITS
